lagfinder.tip.spikes=Spikes\nTicks (or frames) in which it alone took longer than the spike threshold.
lagfinder.tip.calls=Calls\nHow many times it ran per tick (or frame), on average.
lagfinder.tip.active=Active\nPart of the ticks (or frames) in which it ran at all.
lagfinder.tip.instances=Instances\nHow many of them were seen during the scan.
