lagfinder.gui.methods_help=Samples the stack of the scanned thread many times a second and adds up where the time went, method by method and by mod - as Spark's profiler does. Finds what lags inside the code, not only which block.
lagfinder.gui.objects_help=Counts the objects in memory by class a few times along the scan, to see what holds the most and what keeps growing. The game stops for a moment at each count.
lagfinder.gui.alloc_help=Watches the objects being created: which types, by which classes and methods, and how fast. Much garbage made each tick makes the collector run often and the game stutter.
